Package: badgers
Title: Bayesian Graph-Informed Regression with Measurement Error in Predictors
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Zeyu", "Hu", email = "zeyu.hu8888@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
    )
Author: Zeyu Hu [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Zeyu Hu <zeyu.hu8888@gmail.com>
Description: R package for BADGERS, a Bayesian regression method for
    high-dimensional predictors that are observed with measurement error
    through replicate measurements and that are linked by a known or
    partially known graph. It provides an Rcpp-based Markov chain Monte Carlo
    sampler, tuning of the graph-related hyperparameters over a (mu, nu) grid
    using the validation mean squared prediction error, and simulation
    utilities for generating data with a true or noisy working graph.
Depends: R (>= 4.0.0)
License: GPL (>= 3)
